---
layout: layout.vto
title: Farzan Tinati
description: "I'm Farzan Tinati, a curios product oriented fullstack software developer, building high impact software and building industrial products. Interested in 3D printing, IoT and automation. Bsc. Mechanical engineering"
bodyClass: me-page
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero-avatar" src="../assets/avatar-pixel.png" alt="Farzan Tinati" width="160" height="160" />
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero-title">Farzan Tinati</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Product-oriented Full-Stack Mechanical Engineer, 6+ yrs startup experience, shipping high-impact products from concept to launch, BSc
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<hr />

<section class="posts">
  <h2>Posts</h2>
  {{ for post of search.pages("url^=/posts/", "date=desc") }}
    <article class="post-summary">
      <header class="post-header">
        <h3 class="post-title">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        {{ if post.date }}
          <time class="post-date">{{ post.date |> date("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm") }}</time>
        {{ /if }}
      </header>
      {{ if post.tags }}
        <div class="post-tags">
          {{ for tag of post.tags }}
            <span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
          {{ /for }}
        </div>
      {{ /if }}
    </article>
  {{ /for }}
</section>